@title Single-line diagram: the diversity factor, unset and set, in the inputs window, the box and the schedule
@area Reports
# The supply factor entry in Check > Electrical inputs, empty and set; then the diagram and schedule of a board with factors.
open qa/fixtures/distribution-board.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text electrical inputs
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot electrical-inputs-factor-empty
check_layout
expect "Diversity factor at the supply"
key Escape
wait 4
open qa/fixtures/distribution-board-diversity.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text electrical inputs
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot electrical-inputs-factor-set
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text single line
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
shot diversity-diagram
check_blank diversity-diagram
check_layout
click_text Schedule #1
wait 10
shot diversity-schedule
check_layout
